### Essais de l'API depuis Rider (lancer d'abord le profil « http » de Wh40kSim.Web)
@host = http://localhost:5080

### Demande valide : la réponse arrive en Server-Sent Events (progress…, puis result)
POST {{host}}/api/simulations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenario": {
    "attacker": {
      "name": "Escouade",
      "weapons": [
        { "modelCount": 10, "weapon": { "name": "Bolter", "attacks": 2, "skill": 3, "strength": 4 } }
      ]
    },
    "defender": {
      "name": "Cibles",
      "groups": [ { "name": "Gardes", "count": 10, "toughness": 4, "wounds": 1, "save": 4 } ]
    }
  },
  "iterations": 100000,
  "seed": 42
}

### Demande invalide : 400 ProblemDetails (défenseur sans groupe, trop de simulations)
POST {{host}}/api/simulations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenario": {
    "attacker": { "weapons": [ { "weapon": { "name": "Bolter" } } ] },
    "defender": { "groups": [] }
  },
  "iterations": 5000000
}
